stakes-and-discounts/tldr"}, {"title": "Google Play Fest 2026: Rabatte auf Apps, Games & Bücher plus Extra-Punkte", "url": "https://www.monsterdealz.de/medien-streaming/apps-software/google-play-fest-2026/1605952"}, {"title": "Local blog for Japanese speaking developers", "url": "https://developers-jp.googleblog.com/2017/10/announcing-winners-from-indie-games.html"}, {"title": "Here's what happened at the Google Play event that you didn't even know about", "url": "https://www.phonearena.com/news/Heres-what-happened-at-the-Google-Play-event-that-you-didnt-even-know-about_id48704"}, {"title": "See the Colorful Playground (and Giant Slide) That Google Play Brought to a Music Festival", "url": "https://www.bizbash.com/experiential-marketing/see-the-colorful-playground-and-giant-slide-that-google-play-brought-to-a-music-festival"}, {"title": "Google anuncia un evento para el 24 de octubre sobre Google Play", "url": "https://www.xatakandroid.com/mercado/google-anuncia-un-evento-para-el-24-de-octubre-sobre-google-play"}, {"title": "3 things to look forward to at Google Play Live", "url": "https://blog.google/products/google-play/google-play-live-2022/"}]}, "The search returned several articles on Play Fest, but none was the official Google Play blog post itself.\n\nPlay Fest was a weeklong Google Play event from October 13 to 19, 2026, which has already ended as of today. Coverage describes it as combining the store's biggest discounts, point boosts, and contests into a single event. The main draw was a sweepstakes: Play Points members could redeem their points for a chance to win prizes, including exclusive merchandise, premium tech gear, and tickets to major sporting events.\n\nOther elements included:\n- **Discounts:** A broad sale covered apps, games, books, and devices from October 13 through October 19.\n- **Points boosts:** Book buyers got a 15x points boost from October 16-18. Play Pass members got double points and extra boosts starting October 8.\n- **Game leagues:** Play Fest leagues were added to Angry Birds 2, 8 Ball Pool, and Free Fire.\n\nAndroid Authority's coverage was dated October 1, 2026, and called it one of the biggest Play events ever. I did not find the official Google Play blog post, so the details above come from secondary reporting. If you need Google's own wording or the official terms, check the Google Play blog directly."], "durationSeconds": 5.835721292000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_012kzXse2e8rKneZmBxpvsvt", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
